  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Underway Data from the Bering Sea (1978-79)",
  "description": "Underway physical oceanographic data were collected as part of the NOAA Pacific Marine Environmental Laboratory's Processes and Resources of the Bering Sea project from May 1978 to May 1979. Parameters included in this data were temperature, salinity, chlorophyll-a, phaeopigments, phosphate, silicate, nitrate, nitrite, carbon assimilation, pH, alkalinity, ammonia, and oxygen.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To record the underway Data from the Bering Sea (1978-79)",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23505142",
